  shortDescription: Glass-smooth black volcanic flows.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Abyss biome. Come here for specialized runs, rarer materials, and
    work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Sulfur Clumps and Thermal Gel.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Tungsten Chunk and Cooling Cartridge.'
  landmarkIdentity: Obsidian Flows reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot
    basins. Landmarks should feel scarce but memorable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are scarce. Relief should come from one clear
    nook, not constant cover.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Quick strike extraction from hot pockets with short exposure
    windows. Mid-depth: expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local hotspots,
    then return before greed stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is heat vent field or obsidian flow edge. This
    slot should read through flow channel and thermal chimney cluster; use bowls
    and hotspot rims to remember loops.
